{
    "title": "Twilight Land: Hidden Objects",
    "description": "Solve mystical brainteasers in Twilight Land\u2014the most captivating hidden object puzzle game. Uncover mysteries, unravel tricky match-3 puzzles, help restore a small town and unlock bonuses along the way. Join Rosemary Bell as she travels to Twilight Land to find her sister.   \r\n\r\nA MYSTICAL STORYLINE   \r\n\r\nThe main character, Rosemary Bell, is having strange dreams where her missing older sister is trying to contact her. Two weeks prior, her sister got an invitation from a mysterious stranger and headed off to Twilight Land. Rosemary is determined to find out what happened to her.   \r\n\r\nWhen Rosemary enters Twilight Land, she discovers that her sister is under a curse. Now she must solve the mystery of the strange town, save its inhabitants and help her sister. But be careful what you wish for...   \r\n\r\nCAPTIVATING HIDDEN OBJECT SCENES\r\n\r\nJourney through a small 1930s town as you search for hidden objects and match items to progress through the story. Each level in this adventure puzzle game contains charming scenes full of hidden objects or unsolved levels full of match-3 puzzles.   \r\n\r\nCITY RENOVATION AND DESIGN\r\n\r\nUnlock decorations and collections to rebuild the town. Influence its appearance and help bring back its elegance in this stimulating puzzle game.   \r\n\r\nMEET FASCINATING CHARACTERS\r\n\r\nThe town is full of exciting characters waiting for you! Solve mysteries and brainteasers as you work to save the townspeople. Enjoy engaging storylines in this unique puzzle game and find out what really happened here.   \r\n\r\nPLAY PUZZLES ANYWHERE   \r\n\r\nNow you can solve mysteries, enjoy search and find games and match items from anywhere. This mystery game is playable offline, so you can take this hidden objects adventure wherever you go!   \r\n\r\nHelp Rosemary save her sister and find out what unspoken secrets caused the town\u2019s ruin. Download Twilight Land today and begin your mysterious journey!   \r\n\r\n<i>While this game is absolutely free to play, you have the ability to unlock optional bonuses via in-app purchases within the game. You may disable in-app purchases in your device settings.</i>\r\n\r\nYou can play this game whether you\u2019re offline or online.\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\n<b>Game available in:</b> English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish.\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\nCompatibility notes: This game performs best on high-end smartphones and tablets.\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\nG5 Games - World of Adventures\u2122!\r\nCollect them all! Search for <b>\"g5\"</b> in Google Play!\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\nSign up now for a weekly round-up of the best from G5 Games! <b>https://www.g5.com/e-mail</b>\r\n______________________________\r\n\r\n<b>Visit us:</b> https://www.g5.com\r\n<b>Watch us:</b> https://www.youtube.com/g5enter\r\n<b>Find us:</b> https://www.facebook.com/twilightlandgame\r\n<b>Join us:</b> https://www.instagram.com/twilightlandgame\r\n<b>Follow us:</b> https://www.twitter.com/g5games\r\n<b>Game FAQs:</b> https://support.g5.com/hc/en-us/articles/7943788465042\r\n<b>Terms of Service:</b> https://www.g5.com/termsofservice\r\n<b>G5 End User License Supplemental Terms: </b> https://www.g5.com/G5_End_User_License_Supplemental_Terms",
